    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like i just need to \"shake things up\" though. it feels more like the person i used to be is just... gone. like the core of me has evaporated. i'm just a shell. it's terrifying to think that there might not even be a \"me\" left to rediscover.",
